# --- Third-party asset media excluded to stay within the Git LFS budget ---
# These are large binaries from purchased/imported Asset Store packages.
# They remain on disk and Unity works locally; on a fresh clone, re-import
# the packages from the Asset Store to restore this media.
Assets/Feel/**/*.png
Assets/Feel/**/*.wav
Assets/Feel/**/*.mp4
Assets/Feel/**/*.zip
Assets/Plugins/Pixel Crushers/**/*.png
Assets/Plugins/Pixel Crushers/**/*.wav
Assets/Plugins/Pixel Crushers/**/*.mp4
Assets/Plugins/Pixel Crushers/**/*.zip
Assets/Editor Default Resources/Dialogue System/**/*.png
Assets/Editor Default Resources/Dialogue System/**/*.wav
Assets/Gizmos/**/*.png

